      {
        "_id": "69dcfa1f533b7c23b2a1a2cb",
        "questionText": "Fatima and Emeka invested ₦600,000 and ₦400,000 respectively in a business. They share profits in proportion to their investment. If profit is ₦250,000, how much does Fatima get?",
